  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Viet Nam, HIV, Viet Nam Union of Science and Technology Associations (LHH Vietnam)This program has the following goals: To strengthen the roles of civil society and key populations in the HIV/AIDS response. The objectives of this program are: To provide Prevention programs for key populations: IDU, MSM, FSW.  To Remove legal barriers for access to services for key populations.  To strengthen community system</narrative>
  </description>
